    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-1" id="fn-1" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Transport 4 LLC's ownership group also includes: Buckeye Pipe Line Co. LP at 33.33% and Explorer Pipeline Services Co. at 33.33%.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-2" id="fn-2" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Bengal Pipeline Company LLC's ownership group also includes: Shell Midstream Operating LLC at 50%</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-3" id="fn-3" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Date presented is first of two semi-annual payment dates. Interest amount in dollars is the sum of these two equal payments on May 1st and November 1st respectively.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-4" id="fn-4" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Date presented is first of two semi-annual payment dates. Interest amount in dollars is the sum of these two equal payments on May 30th and November 30th respectively.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-5" id="fn-5" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Date presented is first of two semi-annual payment dates. Interest amount in dollars is the sum of these two equal payments on February 28th and August 28th respectively.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-6" id="fn-6" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Date presented is first of two semi-annual payment dates. Interest amount in dollars is the sum of these two equal payments on February 1st and August 1st respectively.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-7" id="fn-7" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Date presented is first of two semi-annual payment dates. Interest amount in dollars is the sum of these two equal payments on April 15th and October 15th respectively.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-8" id="fn-8" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Date presented is first of two semi-annual payment dates. Interest amount in dollars is the sum of these two equal payments on April 1st and October 1st respectively.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-9" id="fn-9" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Date presented is first of two semi-annual payment dates. Interest amount in dollars is the sum of these two equal payments on April 15th and October 15th respectively.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-10" id="fn-10" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Date presented is first of two semi-annual payment dates. Interest amount in dollars is the sum of these two equal payments on May 15th and November 15th respectively.</link:footnote>
